- fix the writer callback loop in `crates/composefs-capi/src/image.rs` (around L292-307), which makes no progress if a callback returns zero, and add a test;
- remove the stale 'CAPI not yet started' comment in `composefs-ctl`'s dispatcher.

Acceptance: CI produces the ABI report, `test-lcfs` passes against Rust, and the existing privileged `capi_mount_*` tests pass. Testing ostree as a consumer (revdep) stays in cgwalters-forge/tracker#12.

